IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-POWERINFER-PARTITION.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIMENSION           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HOT-COUNT           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 COLD-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 GPU-SAVED-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-POWERINFER.
    IF DIMENSION == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE COLD-COUNT = DIMENSION - HOT-COUNT.
    COMPUTE GPU-SAVED-PCT = (COLD-COUNT * 100) / DIMENSION.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 GPU-SAVED-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 COLD-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
